# Stable node_id across normal reboot
name: stable-node-id
version: 1
description: node_id remains unchanged across normal reboot; boot_counter increments.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
reboot
assert node_id unchanged
assert boot_counter 2
reboot
assert node_id unchanged
assert boot_counter 3
reboot
assert node_id unchanged
assert boot_counter 4